    "detailed_description": "Once you\u2019ve found all the words inside each WordSearch, the remaining letters form a sentence that furthers an overarching storyline.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story theme:</h2>Wholesome and friendly. Follow Samuel the pig on his adventure in chapter 1.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2>- 30 puzzles (sized 10x10)<br><br>- 10 words per puzzle <br>- 1 discoverable sentence per puzzle<br>- Unlimited and unrestricted hints if you're stuck.<br>- 5 different fonts to choose from.<br>- Pick from 3 different colour themes, or choose your own entirely.<br>- Each puzzle earns an achievement<br>- Progress is always saved",
